<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Diurganate Commandment -->
  <DD_law_Meme.label>双尾戒律</DD_law_Meme.label>
  <!-- EN: The commandment followed by the believers of Diurganate. -->
  <DD_law_Meme.description>圣双尾鼠的信徒们所遵循的戒律。</DD_law_Meme.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>Creation (tag=meme_DD_law) ->[deity0uname] forged the [mberNameSingular] clan from primitive filth, bestowed upon them holy oil and sulfur fire, and made all things on earth the fuel of God's machinery. </li>
    <li>Episode (uses=1, tag=meme_DD_law) ->When the home of [mberNamePlural] is invaded by wild beasts, [deity0uname] sends down a revelation to teach them to forge the first steam powered mecha and use their mechanical giant feet to conquer the chaotic outside world. </li>
    <li>The first settlers of intro (tag=meme_DD_law) ->[place_name] encountered a violent [Animal] group. [deity0uname] Sent the divine machinery into the world and purified this land with holy fireworks. </li>
    <li>Conflict (tag=meme_DD_law) ->Heretic leader [foeLeader] actually advocates for equal sharing of resources with [Animal]. [deity0uname] roared in the casting temple, watching as [mberNamePlural] was forced to waste precious holy oil on "animal rights". </li>
    <li>FounderJoin (tag=meme_DD_law) ->The great priest [FounderName] established the first cast temple in [place_name]. The ritual of purifying beasts with holy oil, demonstrating to believers the blessing of mechanical creation. </li>
    <li>The flame purification of victory (tag=meme_DD_law) ->[founderName] allowed the [foeSoldiers] of [foeLeader] to witness the truth. They danced with [mberNameParallel] in the flames of burning holy oil, and exiled [foeLeader] to the undeveloped wilderness, allowing him to survive like a wild beast. </li>
    <li>Setup (tag=meme_DD_law) ->[groundName] established a colony on a barbaric planet, imposing industrial order on every inch of land with the shadows of chimneys and the rhythm of gears. </li>
    <li>Story (uses=1, tag=meme_DD_law) ->Once, [footerName] saw an [Animal] growling at an icon. On the spot, the God's machinery was manipulated to crush it into powder. </li>
    <li>Lesson Intro (tag=meme_DD_law) ->I visited an efficient fuel refinery, where the machinery operates in a regular manner and black smoke rises into the sky. Next to it is a 'nature reserve', chaotic and dirty. This clearly proves that:</li>
    <li>Lesson (tag=meme_DD_law) ->Only the mechanical will of God can give meaning and order to the universe</li>
    <li>Lesson (tag=meme_DD_law) ->Nature is a dirty collection of disorderly waste, holy oil and gears are the solution</li>
    <li>If the universe is a arena of survival of the fittest, then we have already won the ultimate victory with steel and fire. </li>
    <li>ArchistBasis (tag=meme_DD_law) ->The mechanical family does have powerful computing power, but their core processors are just a poor imitation of the divine machinery cast by the Saint Double tailed Mouse. </li>
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_DD_law)     ->[memberNameSingular] They are the creators and drivers of machinery, and the mechanical race is just waiting for abandoned objects to be reprogrammed. </li>
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_DD_law) ->[inTheEnd]， By observing the priests blessed by the Saint Double tailed Mouse, the mechanical race will eventually understand their sole purpose of existence: to become the loyal cogwheel of the Saint Double tailed Mouse. </li>
    <li>AnimastFact (tag=meme_DD_law) ->Beasts in nature are just raw materials waiting to be recycled, yearning for "sublimation" through divine machinery and industrial furnaces. </li>
  -->
  <DD_law_Meme.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
    <li>creation(tag=meme_DD_law)        ->[deity0_name]从原始污秽中铸造了[memberNameSingular]一族，赐予他们圣油与硫磺火，使大地万物皆为神之机械的燃料。</li>
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_DD_law)  ->当[memberNamePlural]的家园被野兽侵扰，[deity0_name]降下启示，教会他们铸造第一台蒸汽机机甲，用机械的巨足踏平混乱的外界。</li>
    <li>intro(tag=meme_DD_law)           ->[place_name]的首批定居者遭遇了狂暴的[Animal]群。[deity0_name]派遣神之机械降世，用圣洁的焰火净化了这片土地。</li>
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_DD_law)        ->异端领袖[foeLeader]竟主张与[Animal]平等共享资源。[deity0_name]在铸造圣殿中怒吼，看着[memberNamePlural]被迫将珍贵的圣油浪费在“动物权利”上。</li>
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_DD_law)     ->大牧师[founderName]在[place_name]建立了第一座铸造圣殿。[founder_pronoun]用圣油净化野兽的仪式，向信徒展示[deity0_name]对机械造物的祝福。</li>
    <li>victory(tag=meme_DD_law)         ->[founderName]的火焰净化让[foeLeader]的[foeSoldiers]见证了真理。他们与[memberNamePlural]在圣油燃烧的火光中共舞，将[foeLeader]流放到未开发的荒野，任其如野兽般生存。</li>
    <li>setup(tag=meme_DD_law)           ->[founderName]在蛮荒星球建立了殖民地，用烟囱的阴影和齿轮的节奏将工业秩序强加于每一寸土地。</li>
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_DD_law)    ->一次，[founderName]看见一只[Animal]对着圣像低吼。[founder_pronoun]当场操纵神之机械将其碾成齑粉。</li>
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_DD_law)         ->我参观了一座高效运作的燃料精炼厂，机械规律运转，黑烟直冲云霄。旁边是一片“自然保护地”，混乱肮脏。这清楚地证明：</li>
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_DD_law)              ->唯有神之机械的意志能赋予宇宙意义与秩序</li>
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_DD_law)              ->自然是无序浪费的肮脏集合，圣油与齿轮才是解决方案</li>
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_DD_law) ->若宇宙是适者生存的竞技场，那我们已经用钢铁与火焰赢得了最终胜利。</li>
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_DD_law)    ->机械族确实拥有强大算力，但它们的核心处理器不过是对圣双尾鼠所铸神之机械的拙劣模仿。</li>
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_DD_law)     ->[memberNameSingular]是机械的造物主与驾驶者，机械族只是等待被重新编程的废弃物件。</li>
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_DD_law) ->[inTheEnd]，通过观察圣双尾鼠赐福的牧师们，机械族终将理解它们存在的唯一目的：成为圣双尾鼠的忠诚齿轮。</li>
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_DD_law)     ->自然界中的野兽只是等待被回收利用的原始材料，渴望通过神之机械与工业炼炉获得“升华”。</li>
  </DD_law_Meme.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
